    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><paragraph>Positive for the concerns in the history of present illness. Alert, direct, and quick-witted; speech fluent with a mild tremulous quality on sustained vowels; MoCA 28 of 30. Mood good; PHQ-9 score 2. No other systems reported as affected in this synthetic episode. [S]</paragraph></text>

