<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.2.5"/>
    <code code="10210-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Physical findings of General status Narrative"/>
    <title>General Status</title>
    <text><paragraph>Alert and engaged. At the first visit: TETRAS performance subscale 22 of 64 and activities of daily living subscale 14 of 48. Side-to-side (no-no) head tremor of moderate amplitude, present when sitting and standing and lessened when the head is supported; wavering pitch on a sustained vowel; postural and kinetic tremor of both hands, right slightly more than left, on finger-to-nose testing and when pouring, which she has noticed for several years; spiral drawing with tremor waves; handwriting legible but shaky. No rest tremor, bradykinesia, rigidity, dystonic posturing, or ataxia; normal tandem gait. Falls: none in the past year; Timed Up and Go 9 seconds. Daily impact: spills when carrying full cups, slow to sign autographs and write letters, and the voice tremor is noticeable on sustained notes on stage; independent in all activities and instrumental activities of daily living. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

